{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2008,"convocatoria":"Reserva 2","documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}ax^2+3x&\\text{si }x\\leq2\\\\x^2-bx-4&\\text{si }x\\gt2\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Halla \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) sabiendo que \\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\).","(1 p.) Determina la recta tangente y la recta normal a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=3\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cada trozo es un polinomio. En \\(x=2\\) hace falta continuidad y derivadas laterales iguales:</p>\\[\\text{Continuidad: }\\lim_{x\\to2^-}(ax^2+3x)=4a+6=f(2),\\qquad\\lim_{x\\to2^+}(x^2-bx-4)=-2b\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad4a+6=-2b\\]\\[\\text{Derivabilidad: }f'(2^-)=(2ax+3)\\big|_{x=2}=4a+3,\\qquad f'(2^+)=(2x-b)\\big|_{x=2}=4-b\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad4a+3=4-b\\]<p>De la 2.ª, \\(b=1-4a\\); en la 1.ª: \\(4a+6=-2+8a\\iff a=2\\), y \\(b=-7\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=2\\), \\(b=-7\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>En \\(x=3\\gt2\\): \\(f(x)=x^2+7x-4\\), \\(f(3)=26\\); \\(f'(x)=2x+7\\), \\(f'(3)=13\\).</p><div class='res'>Tangente: \\(y-26=13(x-3)\\), es decir, \\(y=13x-13\\). Normal: \\(y-26=-\\dfrac1{13}(x-3)\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"cont","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"tang","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada la función \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\), definida por \\(g(x)=2x+|x^2-1|\\)","apartados":["(1 p.) Esboza la gráfica de \\(g\\).","(1,5 p.) Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^2g(x)\\,dx\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x^2-1\\geq0\\iff|x|\\geq1\\):</p>\\[g(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2+2x-1&\\text{si }x\\leq-1\\text{ o }x\\geq1\\\\-x^2+2x+1&\\text{si }-1\\lt x\\lt1\\end{cases}\\]<p>Son trozos de parábolas: \\(x^2+2x-1\\) (vértice en \\(x=-1\\)) y \\(-x^2+2x+1\\) (vértice en \\((1,2)\\)). Se enlazan en \\((-1,-2)\\) y \\((1,2)\\) con picos.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='167.3,143.1 169.5,141.4 171.7,139.8 173.8,138.3 176.0,136.8 178.2,135.5 180.3,134.2 182.5,133.0 184.7,131.9 186.8,130.9 189.0,130.0 191.2,129.1 193.3,128.4 195.5,127.7 197.7,127.1 199.8,126.7 202.0,126.3 204.2,126.0 206.3,125.7 208.5,125.6 210.7,125.6 212.8,122.0 215.0,118.3 217.2,114.6 219.3,110.8 221.5,106.9 223.7,102.9 225.8,98.8 228.0,94.6 230.2,90.3 232.3,86.0 234.5,81.5 236.7,77.0 238.8,72.4 241.0,67.7 243.2,62.9 245.3,58.0 247.5,53.0 249.7,48.0 251.8,42.8 254.0,37.6 254.0,160.7 251.8,160.7 249.7,160.7 247.5,160.7 245.3,160.7 243.2,160.7 241.0,160.7 238.8,160.7 236.7,160.7 234.5,160.7 232.3,160.7 230.2,160.7 228.0,160.7 225.8,160.7 223.7,160.7 221.5,160.7 219.3,160.7 217.2,160.7 215.0,160.7 212.8,160.7 210.7,160.7 208.5,160.7 206.3,160.7 204.2,160.7 202.0,160.7 199.8,160.7 197.7,160.7 195.5,160.7 193.3,160.7 191.2,160.7 189.0,160.7 186.8,160.7 184.7,160.7 182.5,160.7 180.3,160.7 178.2,160.7 176.0,160.7 173.8,160.7 171.7,160.7 169.5,160.7 167.3,160.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='24.3,102.9 25.9,105.8 27.5,108.6 29.0,111.5 30.6,114.2 32.2,117.0 33.8,119.6 35.3,122.3 36.9,124.9 38.5,127.4 40.0,129.9 41.6,132.3 43.2,134.7 44.8,137.1 46.3,139.4 47.9,141.7 49.5,143.9 51.0,146.1 52.6,148.2 54.2,150.3 55.8,152.3 57.3,154.3 58.9,156.2 60.5,158.1 62.0,160.0 63.6,161.8 65.2,163.5 66.7,165.2 68.3,166.9 69.9,168.5 71.5,170.1 73.0,171.6 74.6,173.1 76.2,174.5 77.7,175.9 79.3,177.2 80.