<line x1='80.7' y1='157.7' x2='80.7' y2='163.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='77.7' y='174.7' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='124.0' y1='157.7' x2='124.0' y2='163.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='121.0' y='174.7' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='210.7' y1='157.7' x2='210.7' y2='163.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='207.7' y='174.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='254.0' y1='157.7' x2='254.0' y2='163.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='251.0' y='174.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='164.3' y1='195.9' x2='170.3' y2='195.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='151.3' y='199.9' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='164.3' y1='125.6' x2='170.3' y2='125.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='151.3' y='129.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='164.3' y1='90.4' x2='170.3' y2='90.4' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='151.3' y='94.4' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='164.3' y1='55.2' x2='170.3' y2='55.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='151.3' y='59.2' font-size='10'>6</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\int_0^2g(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1(-x^2+2x+1)\\,dx+\\int_1^2(x^2+2x-1)\\,dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{x^3}3+x^2+x\\Bigr]_0^1+\\Bigl[\\frac{x^3}3+x^2-x\\Bigr]_1^2\\]\\[=\\frac53+\\left(\\frac{14}3-\\frac13\\right)=\\frac53+\\frac{13}3=6\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^2g(x)\\,dx=6\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"rep","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}x+y+z=a-1\\\\2x+y+az=a\\\\x+ay+z=1\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Discútelo según los valores del parámetro \\(a\\).","(1 p.) Resuélvelo en el caso \\(a=2\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&1&1&a-1\\\\2&1&a&a\\\\1&a&1&1\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&1\\\\2&1&a\\\\1&a&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+a+2 a\\bigr)-\\bigl(1+a^{2}+2\\bigr)\\]\\[=-a^2+3a-2=-(a-1)(a-2)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(a\\neq1,2\\)<b>:</b> compatible determinado.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(a=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&0\\\\2&1&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+1+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+1+2\\bigr)\\]\\[=-1\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\): incompatible.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(a=2\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&1&1&1\\\\2&1&2&2\\\\1&2&1&1\\end{array}\\right)\\): la 1.ª y la 3.ª columna de \\(A\\) son iguales y la columna de términos independientes coincide con ellas, así que \\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\) (\\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}\\neq0\\)): compatible indeterminado.</p><div class='res'>\\(a\\neq1,2\\): compatible determinado. \\(a=1\\): incompatible. \\(a=2\\): compatible indeterminado</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(a=2\\): \\(x+y+z=1\\), \\(2x+y+2z=2\\). </p><p>Doy a la incógnita \\(z\\) el valor \\(z=t\\) y lo paso al segundo miembro<i class='n' data-t='why'>La incógnita que no está en el menor no nulo pasa al segundo miembro como parámetro; así queda un sistema con tantas ecuaciones como incógnitas y determinante distinto de 0, que se resuelve por Cramer.</i>:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x+y=1 - t\\\\2x+y=2 - 2 t\\end{cases}\\]<p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\2&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1 - t&1\\\\2 - 2 t&1\\end{vmatrix}}{-1}=\\frac{t - 1}{-1}=1 - t\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&1 - t\\\\2&2 - 2 t\\end{vmatrix}}{-1}=0\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=1-t,\\ y=0,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea la recta \\(s\\) dada por \\(\\begin{cases}x-z=-1\\\\2y+z=3\\end{cases}\\)","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano \\(\\pi_1\\) que es paralelo a la recta \\(s\\) y que contiene a la recta \\(r\\), dada por \\(x-1=-y+2=z-3\\).","(1,25 p.) Estudia la posición relativa de la recta \\(s\\) y el plano \\(\\pi_2\\), de ecuación \\(x+y=3\\), y deduce la distancia entre ambos."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(s\\): con \\(z=2\\lambda\\), \\(x=-1+2\\lambda\\), \\(y=\\frac{3-2\\lambda}2\\): \\(s\\equiv\\left(-1+2\\lambda,\\ \\frac32-\\lambda,\\ 2\\lambda\\right)\\), con director \\(\\vec u=(2,-1,2)\\).</p><p>\\(r\\): \\(x-1=-y+2=z-3=t\\Rightarrow r\\equiv(1+t,\\ 2-t,\\ 3+t)\\), por \\(R(1,2,3)\\) con \\(\\vec v=(1,-1,1)\\).</p><p>\\(\\pi_1\\) contiene a \\(r\\) y es paralelo a \\(s\\): su normal es perpendicular a \\(\\vec u\\) y a \\(\\vec v\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec u\\times\\vec v=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\2&-1&2\\\\1&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,0,\\,-1)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x-z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(1-3+D=0\\iff D=2\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\pi_1\\equiv x-z+2=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\vec u\\cdot\\vec n_2=(2,-1,2)\\cdot(1,1,0)=1\\neq0\\): \\(s\\) no es paralela a \\(\\pi_2\\), lo corta en un punto. Corte: \\((-1+2\\lambda)+\\left(\\frac32-\\lambda\\right)=3\\iff\\lambda=\\frac52\\), punto \\(P(4,-1,5)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-75,\"el\":18,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1.576,1.424,8.6],[5.424,-2.424,8.6],[5.424,-2.424,-0.6],[1.576,1.424,-0.6]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[5.424,-2.424,-0.6],\"π₂\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-1.8,1.9,-0.8],[5.4,-1.7,6.4],\"#16a34a\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[5.4,-1.7,6.4],\"s\",\"#16a34a\",6,0],[\"pt\",[4,-1,5],\"P\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m08r2a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m08r2a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m08r2a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m08r2a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='96.1,18.0 156.9,50.5 156.9,246.0 96.1,213.5' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='160.9' y='246.0' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π₂</text><line x1='26.0' y1='208.5' x2='160.5' y2='92.4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='166.5' y='92.4' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><circle cx='134.4' cy='115.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='141.4' y='109.0' font-weight='700'>P</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='39.5' y2='271.3' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='41.9' y='275.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='28.1' y2='265.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='26.6' y='267.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='253.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(s\\) y \\(\\pi_2\\) son secantes (se cortan en \\(P(4,-1,5)\\)), así que la distancia entre ambos es 0</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"pos","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"De entre todas las rectas del plano que pasan por el punto \\((1,2)\\), encuentra aquella que forma con las partes positivas de los ejes coordenados un triángulo de área mínima. Halla el área de dicho triángulo.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La recta corta a los semiejes positivos en \\((a,0)\\) y \\((0,b)\\): \\(\\frac xa+\\frac yb=1\\). Pasa por \\((1,2)\\): \\(\\frac1a+\\frac2b=1\\Rightarrow b=\\frac{2a}{a-1}\\), con \\(a\\gt1\\) para que \\(b\\gt0\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='50.6,41.6 54.4,45.2 58.2,48.8 62.1,52.4 65.9,56.0 69.7,59.6 73.5,63.2 77.4,66.8 81.2,70.4 85.0,74.0 88.8,77.6 92.6,81.2 96.5,84.8 100.3,88.4 104.1,92.0 107.9,95.6 111.8,99.2 115.6,102.8 119.4,106.4 123.2,110.0 127.1,113.6 130.9,117.2 134.7,120.8 138.5,124.4 142.4,128.0 146.2,131.6 150.0,135.2 153.8,138.8 157.6,142.4 161.5,146.0 165.3,149.6 169.1,153.2 172.9,156.8 176.8,160.4 180.6,164.0 184.4,167.6 188.2,171.2 192.1,174.8 195.9,178.4 199.7,182.0 203.5,185.6 203.5,185.6 199.7,185.6 195.9,185.6 192.1,185.6 188.2,185.6 184.4,185.6 180.6,185.6 176.8,185.6 172.9,185.6 169.1,185.6 165.3,185.6 161.5,185.6 157.6,185.6 153.8,185.6 150.0,185.6 146.2,185.6 142.4,185.6 138.5,185.6 134.7,185.6 130.9,185.6 127.1,185.6 123.2,185.6 119.4,185.6 115.6,185.6 111.8,185.6 107.9,185.6 104.1,185.6 100.3,185.6 96.5,185.6 92.6,185.6 88.8,185.6 85.0,185.6 81.2,185.6 77.4,185.6 73.5,185.6 69.7,185.6 65.9,185.6 62.1,185.6 58.2,185.6 54.4,185.6 50.6,185.6' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='35.3,27.2 127.1,113.6 218.8,200.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='127.1' cy='113.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='133.1' y='109.6'>(1,2)</text><circle cx='203.5' cy='185.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='209.5' y='177.6'>(a,0)</text><circle cx='50.6' cy='41.6' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='56.6' y='41.6'>(0,b)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 185.6H294.0M50.6 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='127.1' y1='182.6' x2='127.1' y2='188.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='124.1' y='199.6' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='203.5' y1='182.6' x2='203.5' y2='188.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='200.5' y='199.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='47.6' y1='113.6' x2='53.6' y2='113.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='34.6' y='117.6' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='47.6' y1='41.6' x2='53.6' y2='41.6' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='34.6' y='45.6' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div>\\[A(a)=\\frac{ab}2=\\frac{a^2}{a-1},\\qquad a\\in(1,+\\infty)\\]<p>Estudiamos el signo de \\(A'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[A'(a)=\\frac{2a(a-1)-a^2}{(a-1)^2}=\\frac{a(a-2)}{(a-1)^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{a=2}\\ (a\\gt1)\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 210 108' width='100%' style='max-width:252px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H196' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M65.0 10L101.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 39L101.0 40L99.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(1,5) &lt; 0</text><text x='129.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M143.0 40L179.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M170.0 11L179.0 10L177.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='155.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>A</tspan>′(3) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(A\\) decrece en \\((1,2)\\) debido a que \\(A'(a)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((2,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(A'(a)\\gt0\\): en \\(a=2\\) hay un mínimo absoluto<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>. Entonces \\(b=4\\).</p><div class='res'>La recta \\(\\frac x2+\\frac y4=1\\), es decir, \\(2x+y=4\\). El triángulo tiene área \\(4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"opt","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-6","n":6,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=x^2-1\\) y \\(g(x)=2x+2\\).","apartados":["(0,5 p.) Esboza las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\).","(2 p.) Calcula el área del recinto limitado por dichas gráficas."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es una parábola con vértice en \\((0,-1)\\) que corta al eje en \\(\\pm1\\); \\(g\\) es una recta. Cortes: \\(x^2-1=2x+2\\iff x^2-2x-3=0\\iff x=-1\\) o \\(x=3\\): \\((-1,0)\\) y \\((3,8)\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='70.3,179.7 74.5,176.4 78.7,173.0 82.9,169.6 87.1,166.3 91.3,162.9 95.5,159.6 99.7,156.2 103.9,152.8 108.1,149.5 112.3,146.1 116.5,142.7 120.6,139.4 124.8,136.0 129.0,132.7 133.2,129.3 137.4,125.9 141.6,122.6 145.8,119.2 150.0,115.8 154.2,112.5 158.4,109.1 162.6,105.8 166.8,102.4 171.0,99.0 175.2,95.7 179.4,92.3 183.5,88.9 187.7,85.6 191.9,82.2 196.1,78.8 200.3,75.5 204.5,72.1 208.7,68.8 212.9,65.4 217.1,62.0 221.3,58.7 225.5,55.3 229.7,51.9 233.9,48.6 238.1,45.2 238.1,45.2 233.9,55.1 229.7,64.7 225.5,74.0 221.3,82.9 217.1,91.5 212.9,99.7 208.7,107.6 204.5,115.2 200.3,122.4 196.1,129.3 191.9,135.8 187.7,142.1 183.5,148.0 179.4,153.5 175.2,158.7 171.0,163.6 166.8,168.1 162.6,172.3 158.4,176.2 154.2,179.7 150.0,182.9 145.8,185.8 141.6,188.3 137.4,190.5 133.2,192.3 129.0,193.9 124.8,195.0 120.6,195.9 116.5,196.4 112.3,196.5 108.1,196.4 103.9,195.9 99.7,195.0 95.5,193.9 91.3,192.3 87.1,190.5 82.9,188.3 78.7,185.8 74.5,182.9 70.3,179.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='24.2,122.4 28.0,128.6 31.7,134.6 35.5,140.2 39.3,145.6 43.1,150.8 46.8,155.6 50.6,160.2 54.4,164.5 58.2,168.6 61.9,172.3 65.7,175.8 69.5,179.1 73.3,182.0 77.0,184.7 80.8,187.1 84.6,189.2 88.4,191.1 92.1,192.7 95.9,194.0 99.7,195.0 103.5,195.8 107.2,196.3 111.0,196.5 114.8,196.5 118.5,196.2 122.3,195.6 126.1,194.7 129.9,193.6 133.6,192.2 137.4,190.5 141.2,188.5 145.0,186.3 148.7,183.8 152.5,181.1 156.3,178.0 160.1,174.7 163.8,171.1 167.6,167.3 171.4,163.1 175.2,158.7 178.9,154.0 182.7,149.1 186.5,143.9 190.3,138.4 194.0,132.6 197.8,126.6 201.6,120.3 205.4,113.7 209.1,106.8 212.9,99.7 216.7,92.3 220.5,84.6 224.2,76.7 228.0,68.5 231.8,60.0 235.5,51.2 239.3,42.2 243.1,32.9 246.9,23.3 250.6,13.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='28.4,213.4 147.9,117.5 267.4,21.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='70.3' cy='179.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='26.3' y='173.7'>(−1,0)</text><circle cx='238.1' cy='45.2' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='244.1' y='51.2'>(3,8)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 179.7H294.0M112.3 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='70.3' y1='176.7' x2='70.3' y2='182.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='67.3' y='193.7' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='154.2' y1='176.7' x2='154.2' y2='182.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='151.2' y='193.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='238.1' y1='176.7' x2='238.1' y2='182.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='235.1' y='193.7' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='109.3' y1='112.5' x2='115.3' y2='112.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='96.3' y='116.5' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='109.3' y1='45.2' x2='115.3' y2='45.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='96.3' y='49.2' font-size='10'>8</text></svg></div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(-1\\) y \\(3\\) va por encima la recta (en \\(x=0\\): \\(2\\gt-1\\)):</p>\\[A=\\int_{-1}^3(2x+2-x^2+1)\\,dx=\\int_{-1}^3(-x^2+2x+3)\\,dx=\\Bigl[-\\frac{x^3}3+x^2+3x\\Bigr]_{-1}^3=9-\\left(-\\frac53\\right)=\\frac{32}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{32}3\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":"a, b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-7","n":7,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sabemos que el sistema de ecuaciones \\(\\begin{cases}2x-y+3z=1\\\\x+2y-z=2\\end{cases}\\) tiene las mismas soluciones que el que resulta al añadirle la ecuación \\(ax+y+7z=7\\).","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Determina el valor de \\(a\\).","(1,25 p.) Calcula la solución del sistema inicial de dos ecuaciones, de manera que la suma de los valores de las incógnitas sea igual a la unidad."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El sistema inicial tiene rango 2 (\\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&-1\\\\1&2\\end{vmatrix}=5\\neq0\\)) y es compatible indeterminado. Al añadir la ecuación las soluciones no cambian si la nueva ecuación es combinación de las otras dos, es decir, si el sistema ampliado sigue teniendo \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Hace falta que se anule el determinante de coeficientes. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2&-1&3\\\\1&2&-1\\\\a&1&7\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(28+a+3\\bigr)-\\bigl(6 a-2-7\\bigr)\\]\\[=40-5a\\]<p>\\(a=8\\). Compruebo que también se anula el menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2&-1&1\\\\1&2&2\\\\8&1&7\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(28-16+1\\bigr)-\\bigl(16+4-7\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>Con \\(a=8\\), \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\) ✓.</p><div class='res'>\\(a=8\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Resuelvo el sistema inicial con \\(z=t\\): \\(2x-y=1-3t\\), \\(x+2y=2+t\\). </p><p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&-1\\\\1&2\\end{vmatrix}=5\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1 - 3 t&-1\\\\t + 2&2\\end{vmatrix}}{5}=\\frac{4 - 5 t}{5}=\\frac{4}{5} - t\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}2&1 - 3 t\\\\1&t + 2\\end{vmatrix}}{5}=\\frac{5 t + 3}{5}=t + \\frac{3}{5}\\]<p>Imponemos \\(x+y+z=1\\): \\(\\frac45-t+\\frac35+t+t=1\\iff\\frac75+t=1\\iff t=-\\frac25\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac65,\\ y=\\dfrac15,\\ z=-\\dfrac25\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2008-RESERVA_2.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2008-reserva-2-8","n":8,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dados los puntos \\(A(1,1,0)\\), \\(B(1,1,2)\\) y \\(C(1,-1,1)\\).","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Comprueba que no están alineados y calcula el área del triángulo que determinan.","(1 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene al punto \\(A\\) y es perpendicular a la recta determinada por \\(B\\) y \\(C\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(0,0,2),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(0,-2,1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\0&0&2\\\\0&-2&1\\end{vmatrix}=(4,\\,0,\\,0)\\neq\\vec0\\]<p>Los vectores no son proporcionales: los puntos no están alineados.</p>\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12|(4,0,0)|=2\\]<div class='res'>No están alineados; el área del triángulo es \\(2\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>La normal del plano es \\(\\overrightarrow{BC}=(0,-2,-1)\\parallel(0,2,1)\\): el plano es de la forma \\(2y+z+D=0\\). Contiene a \\(A\\): \\(2+0+D=0\\iff D=-2\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":20,\"el\":15,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,0],[1,1,2],[1,-1,1]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"poly\",[[-0.5,-0.224,2.447],[2.5,-0.224,2.447],[2.5,1.224,-0.447],[-0.5,1.224,-0.447]],\"rgba(240,163,10,.18)\",\"#f0a30a\"],[\"txt\",[2.5,1.224,-0.447],\"π\",\"#f0a30a\",4,0],[\"line\",[1.0,1.8,2.4],[1.0,-1.8,0.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,-1.8,0.6],\"BC\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"pt\",[1,1,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,1,2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[1,-1,1],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m08r2b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m08r2b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m08r2b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m08r2b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='190.2,195.0 190.2,74.5 72.9,123.7' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><polygon points='150.5,18.0 86.4,63.5 171.3,246.0 235.3,200.5' fill='rgba(240,163,10,.18)' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='175.